  "notes": "Singapore deployment. The compatibility page now recommends a per-workspace host (https://{WorkspaceId}.ap-southeast-1.maas.aliyuncs.com/compatible-mode/v1) and lists dashscope-intl as the domain to migrate from; operators can change baseUrl to their workspace host. Explicit cache takes cache_control markers on OpenAI-compatible messages; its USD prices are published only as ratios of the input price (cache read 20%, cache write 125%); the cache prices come from models.dev, which matches those ratios. Prices are the lowest input-length tier. Release dates come from models.dev (https://models.dev/). Models whose source lists only https://models.dev/ were added from models.dev on 2026-11-15, leaving out deprecated and non-chat models. It includes models from other labs that Alibaba hosts (kimi-k3, glm-5.2, deepseek-v4-flash-0731). Image and speech models are served only on DashScope's native API, so their endpoints are https://dashscope-intl.aliyuncs.com/api/v1; operators can switch them to their workspace host too.",
